# The remote publisher materializes these three reviewed files with
# `git archive $GITHUB_SHA` before Buildx receives the context.  Keep this
# defensive allowlist as a second boundary if the workflow is ever edited.
**
!.dockerignore
!containers/
!containers/case-runtime/
!containers/case-runtime/Containerfile
!containers/case-runtime/activation-blocked.mjs
!containers/reviewed-knowledge-runtime/
!containers/reviewed-knowledge-runtime/Containerfile
!src/
!src/reviewed-public-knowledge.ts
!src/reviewed-public-knowledge-server.ts
!src/staging-reviewed-public-knowledge-runtime.ts
!src/reviewed-knowledge-runtime-entrypoint.mjs
